  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Organisational Development Skills Training</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To create a resource bank of sixteen persons with Organisational Development (OD) skills within the AMECEA zone
To equip participants with skills in OD and Assessment in order to understand the environmental factors affecting Caritas activities at all levels and help members take appropriate measures
To help participants create effective teams that can identify and manage their own strengths and weaknesses and strategically manage change and its effects at all levels (zonal and country)
To help participants acquire consultancy and facilitation skills as a local resource for Caritas, in the zone and in Africa at large</narrative>
  </description>
